Translation patch: <PolyDecoder>::from_pb

Change: the per-slot `len() % 4 != 0` checks move before the loop; `core::array::from_fn`
becomes an array literal; the loop over `pts.chunks_exact(4)` becomes a `while` loop.
Why: an early `return` inside a loop does not translate; `array::from_fn` and `chunks_exact` are
not modelled by the Aeneas Lean library.
Behaviour: identical (the same `Err` is returned for the same inputs; the loop has no other
effects before the error).

